 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "must visit him as soon as he comes.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 18.0,
   "x1": 66.75,
   "y1": 21.083333333333332,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“I see no occasion for that. You and the girls may go, or you",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 21.880555555555556,
   "x1": 102.99999999999996,
   "y1": 24.96388888888889,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "may send them by themselves, which perhaps will be still",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 25.761111111111113,
   "x1": 102.99999999999999,
   "y1": 28.844444444444445,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "better; for as you are as handsome as any of them, Mr. Bingley",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 29.64166666666667,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 32.725,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "might like you the best of the party.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 33.522222222222226,
   "x1": 67.08333333333333,
   "y1": 36.60555555555556,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“My dear, you flatter me. I certainly have had my share of",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 37.40277777777778,
   "x1": 102.99999999999999,
   "y1": 40.486111111111114,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "beauty, but I do not pretend to be anything extraordinary now.",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 41.28333333333333,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 44.36666666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When a woman has five grown-up daughters, she ought to give",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 45.163888888888884,
   "x1": 102.99999999999999,
   "y1": 48.24722222222222,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "over thinking of her own beauty.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 49.04444444444444,
   "x1": 63.25,
   "y1": 52.12777777777777,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“In such cases, a woman has not often much beauty to think",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 52.92499999999999,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 56.008333333333326,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "of.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 56.80555555555554,
   "x1": 22.5,
   "y1": 59.88888888888888,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“But, my dear, you must indeed go and see Mr. Bingley",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 60.686111111111096,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 63.76944444444443,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "when he comes into the neighbourhood.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 64.56666666666665,
   "x1": 73.41666666666667,
   "y1": 67.64999999999998,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“It is more than I engage for, I assure you.”",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 68.44722222222221,
   "x1": 79.75,
   "y1": 71.53055555555554,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“But consider your daughters. Only think what an estab-",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 72.32777777777777,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 75.4111111111111,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "lishment it would be for one of them. Sir William and Lady",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 76.20833333333333,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 79.29166666666666,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lucas are determined to go, merely on that account, for in",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 80.08888888888889,
   "x1": 102.99999999999996,
   "y1": 83.17222222222222,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "general, you know, they visit no newcomers. Indeed you must",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 83.96944444444445,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 87.05277777777778,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "go, for it will be impossible for us to visit him if you do not.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 87.85000000000001,
   "x1": 98.0,
   "y1": 90.93333333333334,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“You are over-scrupulous, surely. I dare say Mr. Bingley",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 91.73055555555557,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 94.8138888888889,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "will be very glad to see you; and I will send a few lines by you",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 95.61111111111113,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 98.69444444444446,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "to assure him of my hearty consent to his marrying whichever",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 99.49166666666669,
   "x1": 102.99999999999999,
   "y1": 102.57500000000002,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "he chooses of the girls; though I must throw in a good word for",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 103.37222222222225,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 106.45555555555558,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "my little Lizzy.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 107.25277777777781,
   "x1": 38.75,
   "y1": 110.33611111111114,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“I desire you will do no such thing. Lizzy is not a bit better",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 111.13333333333337,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 114.2166666666667,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "than the others; and I am sure she is not half so handsome as",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 115.01388888888893,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 118.09722222222226,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jane, nor half so good-humoured as Lydia. But you are always",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 118.89444444444449,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 121.97777777777782,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "giving her the preference.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 122.77500000000005,
   "x1": 54.166666666666664,
   "y1": 125.85833333333338,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“They have none of them much to recommend them,” rep-",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 126.65555555555561,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 129.73888888888894,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "lied he; “they are all silly and ignorant like other girls; but",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 130.53611111111115,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 133.6194444444445,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lizzy has something more of quickness than her sisters.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 134.4166666666667,
   "x1": 94.33333333333333,
   "y1": 137.50000000000006,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Mr. Bennet, how can you abuse your own children in such",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 138.29722222222227,
   "x1": 102.99999999999996,
   "y1": 141.38055555555562,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "a way? You take delight in vexing me. You have no compassion",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 142.17777777777783,
   "x1": 102.99999999999999,
   "y1": 145.26111111111118,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "for my poor nerves.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 146.0583333333334,
   "x1": 45.666666666666664,
   "y1": 149.14166666666674,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“You mistake me, my dear. I have a high respect for your",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 149.93888888888895,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 153.0222222222223,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "nerves. They are my old friends. I have heard you mention",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 153.8194444444445,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 156.90277777777786,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "them with consideration these last twenty years at least.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 157.70000000000007,
   "x1": 95.33333333333333,
   "y1": 160.78333333333342,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Ah, you do not know what I suffer.”",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 161.58055555555563,
   "x1": 71.08333333333333,
   "y1": 164.66388888888898,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“But I hope you will get over it, and live to see many young",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 165.4611111111112,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 168.54444444444454,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "men of four thousand a year come into the neighbourhood.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 169.34166666666675,
   "x1": 98.66666666666667,
   "y1": 172.4250000000001,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“It will be no use to us, if twenty such should come, since",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 173.2222222222223,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 176.30555555555566,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "you will not visit them.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 177.10277777777787,
   "x1": 49.916666666666664,
   "y1": 180.18611111111122,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "“Depend upon it, my dear, that when there are twenty, I",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 180.98333333333343,
   "x1": 103.00000000000004,
   "y1": 184.06666666666678,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "will visit them all.”",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 184.863888888889,
   "x1": 43.0,
   "y1": 187.94722222222234,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mr. Bennet was so odd a mixture of quick parts, sarcastic",
   "x0": 22.75,
   "y0": 188.74444444444455,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 191.8277777777779,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "humour, reserve, and caprice, that the experience of three-",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 192.6250000000001,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 195.70833333333346,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": true
  },
  {
   "text": "and-twenty years had been insufficient to make his wife",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 196.50555555555567,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 199.58888888888902,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "understand his character. Her mind was less difficult to",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 200.38611111111123,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 203.46944444444458,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "develop. She was a woman of mean understanding, little infor-",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 204.2666666666668,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 207.35000000000014,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "mation, and uncertain temper. When she was discontented,",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 208.14722222222235,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 211.2305555555557,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "she fancied herself nervous. The business of her life was to get",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 212.0277777777779,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 215.11111111111126,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "her daughters married; its solace was visiting and news.",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 215.90833333333347,
   "x1": 93.75,
   "y1": 218.99166666666682,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Introduction",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 222.8933333333335,
   "x1": 43.0,
   "y1": 227.1683333333335,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": true,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When on board H.M.S. Beagle, as naturalist, I was much struck",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 231.4305555555557,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 234.51388888888906,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "with certain facts in the distribution of the inhabitants of",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 235.31111111111127,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 238.39444444444462,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "South America, and in the geological relations of the present to",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 239.19166666666683,
   "x1": 103.00000000000004,
   "y1": 242.27500000000018,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "the past inhabitants of that continent. These facts seemed to",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 243.0722222222224,
   "x1": 103.00000000000001,
   "y1": 246.15555555555574,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "me to throw some light on the origin of species—that mystery",
   "x0": 18.0,
   "y0": 246.95277777777795,
   "x1": 103.0,
   "y1": 250.0361111111113,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "of mysteries, as it has been called by one of our greatest",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 18,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 21.083333333333332,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "philosophers. On my return home, it occurred to me, in 1837,",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 21.880555555555556,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 24.96388888888889,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "that something might perhaps be made out on this question by",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 25.761111111111113,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 28.844444444444445,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "patiently accumulating and reflecting on all sorts of facts",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 29.64166666666667,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 32.725,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "which could possibly have any bearing on it. After five years’",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 33.522222222222226,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 36.60555555555556,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "work I allowed myself to speculate on the subject, and drew up",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 37.40277777777778,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 40.486111111111114,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "some short notes; these I enlarged in 1844 into a sketch of the",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 41.28333333333333,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 44.36666666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "conclusions, which then seemed to me probable: from that",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 45.163888888888884,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 48.24722222222222,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "period to the present day I have steadily pursued the same",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 49.04444444444444,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 52.12777777777777,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "object. I hope that I may be excused for entering on these per-",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 52.92499999999999,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 56.008333333333326,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "sonal details, as I give them to show that I have not been hasty",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 56.80555555555554,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 59.88888888888888,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "in coming to a decision.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 60.686111111111096,
   "x1": 141.66666666666666,
   "y1": 63.76944444444443,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My work is now nearly finished; but as it will take me two",
   "x0": 114.75,
   "y0": 64.56666666666665,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 67.64999999999998,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "or three more years to complete it, and as my health is far",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 68.44722222222221,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 71.53055555555554,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "from strong, I have been urged to publish this Abstract. I have",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 72.32777777777777,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 75.4111111111111,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "more especially been induced to do this, as Mr. Wallace, who is",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 76.20833333333333,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 79.29166666666666,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "now studying the natural history of the Malay archipelago, has",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 80.08888888888889,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 83.17222222222222,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "arrived at almost exactly the same general conclusions that I",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 83.96944444444445,
   "x1": 194.99999999999991,
   "y1": 87.05277777777778,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "have on the origin of species. Last year he sent to me a memoir",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 87.85000000000001,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 90.93333333333334,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "on this subject, with a request that I would forward it to Sir",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 91.73055555555557,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 94.8138888888889,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Charles Lyell, who sent it to the Linnean Society, and it is pub-",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 95.61111111111113,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 98.69444444444446,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "lished in the third volume of the Journal of that Society.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 99.49166666666669,
   "x1": 184.5,
   "y1": 102.57500000000002,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This Abstract, which I now publish, must necessarily be",
   "x0": 114.75,
   "y0": 103.37222222222225,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 106.45555555555558,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "imperfect. I cannot here give references and authorities for my",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 107.25277777777781,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 110.33611111111114,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "several statements; and I must trust to the reader reposing",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 111.13333333333337,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 114.2166666666667,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "some confidence in my accuracy. No doubt errors will have",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 115.01388888888893,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 118.09722222222226,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "crept in, though I hope I have always been cautious in trusting",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 118.89444444444449,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 121.97777777777782,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "to good authorities alone. I can here give only the general",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 122.77500000000005,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 125.85833333333338,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "conclusions at which I have arrived, with a few facts in",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 126.65555555555561,
   "x1": 195.00000000000003,
   "y1": 129.73888888888894,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "illustration, but which, I hope, in most cases will suffice. No",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 130.53611111111115,
   "x1": 194.99999999999991,
   "y1": 133.6194444444445,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "one can feel more sensible than I do of the necessity of hereaf-",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 134.4166666666667,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 137.50000000000006,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "ter publishing in detail all the facts, with references, on which",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 138.29722222222227,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 141.38055555555562,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "my conclusions have been grounded; and I hope in a future",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 142.17777777777783,
   "x1": 194.99999999999991,
   "y1": 145.26111111111118,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "work to do this. For I am well aware that scarcely a single",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 146.0583333333334,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 149.14166666666674,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "point is discussed in this volume on which facts cannot be",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 149.93888888888895,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 153.0222222222223,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "adduced, often apparently leading to conclusions directly",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 153.8194444444445,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 156.90277777777786,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "opposite to those at which I have arrived. A fair result can be",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 157.70000000000007,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 160.78333333333342,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "obtained only by fully stating and balancing the facts and",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 161.58055555555563,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 164.66388888888898,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "arguments on both sides of each question; and this cannot pos-",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 165.4611111111112,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 168.54444444444454,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "sibly be here done.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 169.34166666666675,
   "x1": 135.41666666666666,
   "y1": 172.4250000000001,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In considering the Origin of Species, it is quite conceivable",
   "x0": 114.75,
   "y0": 173.2222222222223,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 176.30555555555566,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "that a naturalist, reflecting on the mutual affinities of organic",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 177.10277777777787,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 180.18611111111122,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "beings, on their embryological relations, their geographical",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 180.98333333333343,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 184.06666666666678,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "distribution, geological succession, and other such facts, might",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 184.863888888889,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 187.94722222222234,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "come to the conclusion that each species had not been",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 188.74444444444455,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 191.8277777777779,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "independently created, but had descended, like varieties, from",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 192.6250000000001,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 195.70833333333346,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "other species. Nevertheless, such a conclusion, even if well",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 196.50555555555567,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 199.58888888888902,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "founded, would be unsatisfactory, until it could be shown how",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 200.38611111111123,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 203.46944444444458,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "the innumerable species inhabiting this world have been",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 204.2666666666668,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 207.35000000000014,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "modified, so as to acquire that perfection of structure and",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 208.14722222222235,
   "x1": 194.99999999999991,
   "y1": 211.2305555555557,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "coadaptation which most justly excites our admiration.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 212.0277777777779,
   "x1": 184.33333333333334,
   "y1": 215.11111111111126,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Naturalists continually refer to external conditions, such as",
   "x0": 114.75,
   "y0": 215.90833333333347,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 218.99166666666682,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "climate, food, and so on, as the only possible cause of variation.",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 219.78888888888903,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 222.87222222222238,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In one very limited sense, as we shall hereafter see, this may",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 223.6694444444446,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 226.75277777777794,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "be true; but it is preposterous to attribute to mere external",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 227.55000000000015,
   "x1": 195.00000000000009,
   "y1": 230.6333333333335,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "conditions, the structure, for instance, of the woodpecker, with",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 231.4305555555557,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 234.51388888888906,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "its feet, tail, beak, and tongue, so admirably adapted to catch",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 235.31111111111127,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 238.39444444444462,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "insects under the bark of trees. In the case of the misseltoe,",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 239.19166666666683,
   "x1": 194.99999999999997,
   "y1": 242.27500000000018,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "which draws its nourishment from certain trees, which has",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 243.0722222222224,
   "x1": 195.0,
   "y1": 246.15555555555574,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "seeds that must be transported by certain birds, and which has",
   "x0": 110.0,
   "y0": 246.95277777777795,
   "x1": 194.99999999999991,
   "y1": 250.0361111111113,
   "col": 1,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  }
 ],
 "meta": [
